    english: First half of extra time begins!
  - key: match_event_kickoff_4
    korean: "\uC5F0\uC7A5 \uD6C4\uBC18\uC804 \uC2DC\uC791!"
    english: Second half of extra time begins!
  - key: match_event_halftime_1
    korean: "\uC804\uBC18 \uC885\uB8CC \uD718\uC2AC."
    english: Whistle blows for half-time.
  - key: match_event_halftime_2
