  - key: synergy_big_and_small_name
    korean: "\uBE45\uC564\uC2A4\uBAB0"
    english: Big & Small
  - key: synergy_big_and_small_desc
    korean: "\uC7A5\uC2E0 \uC2A4\uD2B8\uB77C\uC774\uCEE4 + \uB2E8\uC2E0 \uC719\uC5B4
      \uC870\uD569. \uD5E4\uB354\uACE8 +10% / \uD06C\uB85C\uC2A4 \uACB0\uC815 +10%."
    english: Tall striker paired with short wingers. +10% headed goals / +10% cross
      finishing.
  - key: synergy_target_speedster_name
    korean: "\uD0C0\uAC9F+\uBC1C\uB9C8\uB2C8"
    english: Target & Speedster
  - key: synergy_target_speedster_desc
    korean: "\uD0C0\uAC9F\uB9E8 \uC2A4\uD2B8\uB77C\uC774\uCEE4 + \uBE60\uB978 \uC719\uC5B4.
      \uCE74\uC6B4\uD130 \uC5B4\uD0DD +15%."
    english: Target Man with pacy wingers. +15% counter attacks.
  - key: synergy_possession_name
    korean: "\uC628\uBCFC\uC774\uB9C8\uC774\uC6E8\uC774"
    english: Possession
  - key: synergy_possession_desc
    korean: "\uD328\uC2A4 + \uBE44\uC804 \uC88B\uC740 \uBBF8\uB4DC\uD544\uB354 2\uBA85.
      \uC810\uC720\uC728 +5% / \uD328\uC2A4 \uC131\uACF5 +5%."
    english: Two midfielders with elite passing and vision. +5% possession / +5%
      pass success.
  - key: synergy_defensive_wall_name
    korean: "\uACE8\uB2C8\uC544"
    english: Defensive Wall
  - key: synergy_defensive_wall_desc
    korean: "\uC13C\uD130\uBC31 2\uBA85\uC758 \uAC15\uB825\uD55C \uD0DC\uD074\xB7\uB9C8\uD0B9.
      \uC2E4\uC810 -10%."
    english: Two centre-backs locking down the area. -10% goals conceded.
  - key: synergy_wingback_duo_name
    korean: "\uC11C\uD504-\uC2A4\uD14C\uD30C"
    english: Wing-Back Duo
  - key: synergy_wingback_duo_desc
    korean: "\uC2A4\uD0DC\uBBF8\uB098\xB7\uADFC\uBA74\uC131 \uC88B\uC740 \uC591\uCABD
      \uD480\uBC31. \uD06C\uB85C\uC2A4 \uBE48\uB3C4 +20%."
    english: High-stamina and hard-working full-backs. +20% cross frequency.
  - key: synergy_double_pivot_name
    korean: "\uB354\uBE14 \uD53C\uBCF4\uD14C"
    english: Double Pivot
  - key: synergy_double_pivot_desc
    korean: "\uC218\uBE44\uD615 \uBBF8\uB4DC\uD544\uB354 2\uBA85. \uC911\uC6D0 \uC810\uC720
      +10% / \uCC28\uB2E8 +10%."
    english: Two defensive midfielders. +10% midfield control / +10% interceptions.
  - key: synergy_trequartista_name
    korean: "\uD2B8\uB808\uC790\uB974\uD14C"
    english: Trequartista
  - key: synergy_trequartista_desc
    korean: "\uACF5\uACA9\uD615 \uBBF8\uB4DC\uD544\uB354\uC758 \uCC3D\uC758\uC131.
      \uD0A4\uD328\uC2A4 \uBE48\uB3C4 +20%."
    english: Creative attacking midfielder. +20% key pass frequency.
  - key: synergy_false_nine_name
    korean: "\uD384\uC2A49"
    english: False 9
  - key: synergy_false_nine_desc
    korean: "\uAC70\uC9D3 9\uBC88\uC758 \uBC15\uC2A4 \uCE68\uD22C. \uB4DC\uB9AC\uBE14
      \uBC15\uC2A4 \uC9C4\uC785 +15%."
    english: False 9 dropping deep and arriving late. +15% dribble box entries.
  - key: synergy_diamond_midfield_name
    korean: "\uB2E4\uC774\uC544\uBAAC\uB4DC \uBBF8\uB4DC"
    english: Diamond Midfield
